{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/csbiwc","slide":1,"text":"Welcome to Health Surveys and Small-Area Evidence. This lesson begins with one principle: local evidence must retain design, uncertainty, and disclosure safeguards. We will connect that principle to an accountable health decision and make it testable in the companion notebook.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N12, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
