{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/wz5z5c","slide":3,"text":"These five controls form one operating chain. We begin with survey design, move through weights and precision, and finish with model assumptions and disclosure. Every control must be explicit, reviewable, and owned.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N12, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
