{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gry9sfip","slide":4,"text":"District estimates show design-based and model-based uncertainty before publication.","textPreview":"District estimates show design-based and model-based uncertainty before publication.","textChars":84,"textLines":1,"bbox":[88,280,630,110]}
