{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ibcb8d","slide":5,"text":"The notebook converts the lesson into executable evidence. Produce small-area estimates and test precision and disclosure gates. As you review the saved outputs, focus on what the evidence supports, what remains uncertain, and the condition that requires abstention or escalation.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N12, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
