{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/szq1gvul","slide":6,"text":"3","textPreview":"3","textChars":1,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,415,45,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t0z290b6","slide":6,"text":"State when to abstain, escalate, monitor, and retire.","textPreview":"State when to abstain, escalate, monitor, and retire.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[116,412,800,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/6x8jelcf","slide":6,"bbox":[930,252,230,230]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/7yhk7qt0","slide":6,"text":"SUCCESS","textPreview":"SUCCESS","textChars":7,"textLines":1,"bbox":[960,280,170,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gnalkfuh","slide":6,"text":"A reviewer can see\nwhat the system knows,\nwhat it cannot decide,\nand who remains accountable.","textPreview":"A reviewer can see | what the system knows, | what it cannot decide, | and who remains accountable.","textChars":93,"textLines":4,"bbox":[958,330,175,120]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gf66z9","slide":6,"text":"Now transfer the contract to a new health-service case. Name the decision owner and lawful action. Define the evidence, horizon, and failure conditions. Then state when the system must abstain, escalate, be monitored, or be retired. A strong answer keeps human authority visible.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N12, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}
