{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qh8zutsf","slide":8,"text":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textPreview":"If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer for review.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[58,568,1050,44]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/abp7y5","slide":8,"text":"Before deployment, ask five questions. Is survey design clear? Is weights documented? Is precision testable? Is model assumptions governed? And is disclosure explicit? If one critical answer is missing, pause and refer the system for review.\n\n[Sources]\n- Canonical notebook V7_B_N12, SRAI Book 7 v1.0."}